
Description:

MDN/parse (RFC 9007) is implemented.  It was a stub that answered
notParsable for every blob.

MDN/send now issues a well-formed null envelope sender.  It used to send
"MAIL FROM:<<>>", which SMTP servers reject.


Documentation:

None.  The behaviour follows the cited specification as written.


